      "official_mark_scheme_text": "Resolve either parallel or perpendicular to plane — M1. Guidance: Three relevant terms in either equation.\n$P\\cos8^\\circ=F+12g\\sin25^\\circ$ — A1.\n$12g\\cos25^\\circ=R+P\\sin8^\\circ$ — A1.\n$F=0.3R$ — M1. Guidance: $R$ must involve components of both $12g$ and $P$.\n$P\\cos8^\\circ=0.3(12g\\cos25^\\circ-P\\sin8^\\circ)+12g\\sin25^\\circ$ — M1. Guidance: Attempt to solve for $P$, using equations with the correct number of relevant terms in both.\n$P=80.8$ — A1. Guidance: From $80.755\\ldots$; allow $P\\le80.8$. If more than one case is considered for direction of friction, a choice must be made for final answer.\nAlternative scheme: resolving vertically or horizontally — M1, correct number of terms; $R\\cos25^\\circ+P\\sin33^\\circ=12g+F\\sin25^\\circ$ — A1; $P\\cos33^\\circ=F\\cos25^\\circ+R\\sin25^\\circ$ — A1; $F=0.3R$ — M1; solve simultaneous equations in $P$ and $R$ — M1, may see $R=97.5$; $P=80.8$ — A1 with same guidance.\nTotal: 6.",
